'''Carrot''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually for 50 [[coins]] {{Currency|Old Coin}}, or by purchasing the whole bundle during the [[Easter Event 2016|2016 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is light green with carrots imprinted all over it, hence the name. The guard is orange, and the handle is solid black with a dark orange tint.

== Trivia==
*Carrot is the second of the five knives included in the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Easter_Set Easter Set].
*The design of this knife is very similar to [[Egg]], but the Easter eggs are replaced with carrots.
*Carrot’s model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/Carrot-item?id=387874071 here].

